hadiths[87]{hadithnumber,text}:
"398","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Allah ne namaz farz ki jab farz ki, do do rakatein, hazar aur safar mein. Phir safar ki namaz baqi rakhi gayi aur hazar ki namaz mein izafa kiya gaya."
"399","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se Hafs bin Asim ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ne hamein bayan kiya aur farmaya: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath raha to main ne Aap ko safar mein nafl parhte nahi dekha. Aur Allah Jalla Zikruhu ne farmaya [beshak tumhare liye Rasulullah mein umda namuna hai]."
"400","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Madina mein Zuhr chaar parhi, aur Dhu al-Hulaifa mein do."
"401","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Madina se Makkah ki taraf nikle. To Aap do do rakatein parhte rahe yahan tak ke hum Madina laute. Yahya bin Abi Ishaq ne un se poochha, unhon ne kaha: Kya tum Makkah mein kuchh thehre? Unhon ne kaha: Hum us mein dus din thehre."
"402","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Mina mein do rakatein parhein, Abu Bakr aur Umar ke sath, aur Usman ke sath un ki khilafat ke shuru mein, phir unhon ne poori ki."
"403","[AI-translation] Hazrat Haritha bin Wahb al-Khuza'i (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein namaz parhayi jabke hum jitne kabhi they us se zyada aur pur-aman they, Mina mein do rakatein."
"404","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne sardi aur hawa wali raat mein namaz ke liye azan kahi, phir farmaya: Suno! Rehalon mein namaz parho. Phir farmaya: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) muazzin ko hukm farmate, jab sardi aur barish wali raat hoti, ke wo kahe: Suno! Rehalon mein namaz parho."
"405","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne barish wale din apne muazzin se kaha: Jab tum kaho ke main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain to na kaho ke namaz ke liye aao, kaho ke apne gharon mein namaz parho. To goya logon ne na-pasand kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Ye us ne kiya jo mujh se behtar tha. Beshak Juma lazim hai, aur beshak main ne na-pasand kiya ke tumhe mushqqat mein dalun aur tum keechad aur phislan mein chalo."
"406","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) safar mein apni sawari par namaz parhte jidhar wo Aap ko le jati, ishare se, raat ki namaz, farzon ke siwa. Aur apni sawari par witr parhte."
"407","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amir bin Rabi'a (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Aap safar mein raat mein apni sawari ki peeth par nafl parhte jidhar wo Aap ko le jati."
"408","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Anas bin Sirin ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Anas ka istiqbal kiya jab wo Sham se aaye. To hum unhe Ain al-Tamr mein mile. Phir main ne unhe gadhe par namaz parhte dekha, jabke un ka chehra is taraf tha, matlab Qibla ke bayein taraf. To main ne arz kiya: Main ne tumhe Qibla ke siwa kisi aur taraf namaz parhte dekha. To unhon ne kaha: Agar main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aisa karte na dekha hota to main na karta."
"409","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke jab safar mein chalna Aap ko jaldi mein dalta to Aap Maghrib muakkhar farmate yahan tak ke use Isha se jama farmate."
"410","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab suraj dhalne se pehle kooch farmate to Zuhr ko Asr ke waqt tak muakkhar farmate, phir utarte aur un dono ko jama farmate. Phir agar kooch se pehle suraj dhal jata to Zuhr parhte phir sawar hote."
"411","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath aath jama karke parhein, aur saat jama karke."
"412","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Tum mein se koi apni namaz mein se shaitan ke liye kuchh na banaye, ye samjhe ke us par lazim hai ke wo dayein ke siwa na phire. Beshak main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aksar bayein se phirte dekha."
"413","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Malik bin Buhaina (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek shakhs ko dekha jab namaz khadi ki gayi thi, wo do rakatein parh raha tha. Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) phire to log Aap se lipat gaye. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Fajr chaar? Fajr chaar?"
"414","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada al-Sulami (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to use chahiye ke baithne se pehle do rakatein parhe."
"415","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek ladayi mein tha. To mera oont sust ho gaya aur thak gaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas aaye aur farmaya: Jabir? To main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara kya haal hai? Main ne arz kiya: Mera oont sust ho gaya hai aur thak gaya hai. Aur main subah aaya. Phir hum masjid aaye to Aap ko masjid ke darwaze par paya. Aap ne farmaya: Ab aaye ho? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Apna oont chhoro aur dakhil ho kar do rakatein parho. Phir main dakhil hua aur namaz parhi."
"416","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) amal chhor dete jabke Aap pasand farmate ke use karein, is dar se ke log use karein aur un par farz kar diya jaye. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Chasht ki nafl kabhi nahi parhi, jabke main use parhti hun."
"417","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Hani se Ibn Abi Laila ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein kisi ne khabar nahi di ke us ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Chasht parhte dekha, siwaye Umm Hani ke. Unhon ne zikr kiya ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Makkah ki fatah ke din un ke ghar mein ghusl farmaya. Phir aath rakatein parhein. Phir main ne Aap ko is se halki namaz parhte nahi dekha, magar Aap ruku aur sajda poora farmate."
"418","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere khalil ne mujhe teen wasiyyat farmayein, main unhe marte dam tak nahi chhorunga: Har mahine teen din ke roze, Chasht ki namaz, aur witr par soना."
"419","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hafsa (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Fajr ke liye muazzin pukarta aur subah zahir ho jati to namaz khadi hone se pehle do halki rakatein parhte."
"420","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fajr ki namaz ke elan aur iqamat ke darmiyan do halki rakatein parhte."
"421","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fajr ki namaz se pehle do rakatein halki farmate, yahan tak ke main kehti ke kya Aap ne Umm al-Kitab parhi?"
"422","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nawafil mein se kisi cheez ki Fajr ki do rakaton se zyada pabandi na farmate."
"423","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Zuhr se pehle do sajde [rakatein] parhein, Zuhr ke baad do sajde, Maghrib ke baad do sajde, Isha ke baad do sajde, aur Juma ke baad do sajde. Raha Maghrib aur Isha, wo Aap ke ghar mein."
"424","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko raat ki namaz mein kisi cheez mein baith kar parhte nahi dekha. Yahan tak ke jab Aap budhe ho gaye to baith kar parhte. Phir jab surat mein se tees ya chalees ayatein baqi rehti to khade ho jate aur unhe parhte, phir ruku karte."
"425","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baith kar namaz parhte. Phir baith kar parhte. Phir jab Aap ki qiraat mein se tees ya chalees ayaton ke qareeb baqi rehti to khade ho jate aur use khade hokar parhte, phir ruku karte, phir sajda karte. Doosri rakat mein aisa hi karte. Phir jab Aap apni namaz poori karte to dekhte. Phir agar main bedar hoti to mujh se baat karte, aur agar main soyi hoti to let jate."
"426","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Abu Salama bin Abd al-Rahman ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Aisha se poochha: Ramazan mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz kaisi thi? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ramazan mein aur us ke siwa mein gyarah rakaton se zyada na farmate. Chaar parhte, phir un ki khoobi aur lambayi ke bare mein na poochho. Phir chaar parhte, phir un ki khoobi aur lambayi ke bare mein na poochho. Phir teen parhte. Aisha ne kaha: Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum witr se pehle sote ho? To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Meri dono aankhein soti hain aur mera dil nahi sota."
"427","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) raat mein terah rakatein parhte. Un mein witr aur Fajr ki do rakatein."
"428","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Aswad ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha se poochha: Raat mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz kaisi thi? Unhon ne kaha: Aap us ke shuru mein sote aur aakhir mein uthte. Phir namaz parhte, phir apne bistar ki taraf laut-te. Phir jab muazzin azan kehta to uthte. Phir agar Aap ko hajat hoti to ghusl farmate, warna wuzu farmate aur nikalte."
"429","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Masrooq ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha se poochha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kaun sa amal sab se mehboob tha? Unhon ne kaha: Hamesha rehne wala. Main ne poochha: Aap kab uthte? Unhon ne kaha: Aap uthte jab murgh ki awaz sunte."
"430","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aap ko mere paas sote ke siwa na pati, matlab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko."
"431","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne poori raat witr parha, aur Aap ka witr sahar tak khatm hota."
"432","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se raat ki namaz ke bare mein poochha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Raat ki namaz do do hai. Phir jab tum mein se koi subah se dare to ek rakat parhe jo us ne parhi usے witr bana degi."
"433","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Raat mein apni aakhri namaz witr banao."
"434","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hamara Rab Tabarak wa Ta'ala har raat pehle aasman ki taraf nazil hota hai, jab raat ka aakhri tihayi baqi rehta hai. Farmata hai: Kaun mujhe pukarta hai ke main use jawab dun? Kaun mujh se mangta hai ke main use dun? Kaun mujh se maghfirat mangta hai ke main use bakhsh dun?"
"435","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan mein iman aur sawab ki niyat se qayam kare us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"436","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) raat ke darmiyan ek raat nikle aur masjid mein namaz parhi. To mardon ne Aap ki namaz se namaz parhi. Phir logon ne subah guftagu ki. Phir un mein se aksar jama ho gaye aur Aap ke sath namaz parhi. Phir logon ne subah guftagu ki. Phir teesri raat masjid wale zyada ho gaye. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nikle aur unhon ne Aap ki namaz se namaz parhi. Phir jab chauthi raat thi to masjid apne walon se tang ho gayi, yahan tak ke Aap Fajr ki namaz ke liye nikle. Phir jab Aap ne Fajr poori ki to logon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur shahadat parhi, phir farmaya: Amma ba'd! Beshak tumhari jagah mujh par chhupi nahi rahi. Lekin mujhe dar hua ke tum par farz kar di jayegi aur tum us se aajiz ho jaoge."
"437","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Maimuna ke paas raat guzari. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) uthe aur apni hajat ke liye gaye. Aap ne apna chehra aur hath dhoye phir so gaye. Phir uthe aur mashkeeze ke paas aaye aur us ka tasma khola. Phir wuzu farmaya, do wuzuon ke darmiyan ka wuzu, zyada na farmaya jabke poora farmaya. Phir namaz parhi. Phir main utha aur angdayi li, is na-pasand se ke Wo samjhein ke main Aap ka intezar kar raha tha. Phir main ne wuzu kiya. Phir Aap namaz parhne khade hue. Phir main Aap ke bayein khada hua. To Aap ne mera kaan pakda aur mujhe apne dayein ghumaya. Phir Aap ki namaz terah rakatein poori hui. Phir Aap let gaye aur so gaye yahan tak ke kharrate lene lage, aur jab Aap sote to kharrate lete. Phir Bilal ne Aap ko namaz ki khabar di. Phir Aap ne namaz parhi aur wuzu na farmaya. Aur Aap apni dua mein kehte: Ae Allah! Mere dil mein noor farma, meri nazar mein noor, mere kaan mein noor, mere dayein noor, mere bayein noor, mere upar noor, mere neeche noor, mere samne noor, aur mere liye noor farma. Kuraib ne kaha [Ibn Abbas se rawi]: Aur saat sandooq mein. Phir main Abbas ki aulad mein se ek shakhs se mila to us ne mujhe un se bayan kiya. Phir us ne meri haddi, gosht, khoon, baal aur khaal zikr ki, aur do khaslatein zikr ki."
"438","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo ek raat Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Maimuna ke paas rahe, jo un ki khala thein. Phir main takiye ke aade let gaya, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke ghar wale us ki lambayi mein lete. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) so gaye yahan tak ke jab aadhi raat hui ya us se thodi pehle ya us se thodi baad, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bedar hue. Phir baithe aur apne hath se apne chehre se neend ponchhne lage. Phir Surah Aal Imran ki aakhri dus ayatein parhein. Phir latki hui mashkeeze ki taraf uthe aur us se wuzu farmaya aur acha wuzu farmaya. Phir khade hokar namaz parhne lage. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Phir main utha aur waisa hi kiya jaisa Aap ne kiya. Phir gaya aur Aap ke pehlu mein khada hua. Phir Aap ne apna dayan hath mere sar par rakha aur mera dayan kaan pakad kar use marodne lage. Phir Aap ne do rakatein parhein, phir do rakatein, phir do rakatein, phir do rakatein, phir do rakatein, phir do rakatein, phir witr parha. Phir lete rahe yahan tak ke muazzin Aap ke paas aaya. Phir Aap khade hue aur do halki rakatein parhein, phir nikle aur Fajr parhi."
"439","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz terah rakatein thi, matlab raat mein."
"440","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab raat mein tahajjud parhte to farmate: Ae Allah! Tere liye hamd hai, Tu aasmanon aur zameen ka noor hai. Tere liye hamd hai, Tu aasmanon aur zameen ko qayam rakhne wala hai. Tere liye hamd hai, Tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo un mein hain sab ka Rab hai. Tu haq hai, Tera wada haq hai, Tera qaul haq hai, Teri mulaqat haq hai, Jannat haq hai, Dozakh haq hai, Nabi haq hain aur Qayamat haq hai. Ae Allah! Tere liye musalman hua, Tujh par iman laya, Tujh par tawakkul kiya, Teri taraf lauta, Tere sath jhagda kiya, Teri taraf faisla le gaya. Phir mujhe bakhsh de jo main ne aage bheja aur jo peechhe kiya, jo chhupaya aur jo zahir kiya. Tu mera mabood hai, Tere siwa koi mabood nahi."
"441","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek raat namaz parhi. To Aap barabar khade rahe yahan tak ke main ne bure kaam ka irada kiya. Un se kaha gaya: Tum ne kya irada kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne irada kiya ke baith jaun aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko chhor dun."
"442","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas ek shakhs ka zikr hua jo apni raat soya raha yahan tak ke subah ho gayi. Aap ne farmaya: Wo aisa shakhs hai jis ke dono kaanon mein shaitan ne peshab kar diya. Ya farmaya: Us ke kaan mein."
"443","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe aur Nabi ki beti Fatima (alaihissalam) ko raat mein jagaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum dono namaz nahi parhte? To main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Hamari jaanein Allah ke hath mein hain. Phir jab Wo chahega ke hamein uthaye, hamein uthayega. Phir Aap laut gaye jab hum ne ye kaha, aur meri taraf koi cheez na lautayi. Phir main ne Aap ko suna jabke Aap peeth pher rahe they, apni raan par marte hue, jabke Aap farma rahe they: [Aur insan sab cheezon se zyada jhagda karne wala hai]."
"444","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Shaitan tum mein se ek ke sar ke peechhe jab wo sota hai teen girah lagata hai. Har girah par marta hai: Tum par lambi raat hai, so jao. Phir agar wo bedar ho aur Allah ko yaad kare to ek girah khul jati hai. Phir agar wuzu kare to ek girah khul jati hai. Phir agar namaz parhe to ek girah khul jati hai. Phir wo subah chust aur achhe dil se karta hai. Warna wo subah bure dil aur sust hokar karta hai."
"445","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Apne gharon mein apni namaz mein se kuchh rakho aur unhe qabrein na banao."
"446","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne Rab ko yaad karta hai aur jo yaad nahi karta us ki misal zinda aur murda jaisi hai."
"447","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Thabit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ramazan mein chatai se ek hujra banaya. Phir us mein chand raatein namaz parhi. Phir Aap ke sathiyon mein se kuchh ne Aap ki namaz se namaz parhi. Phir jab Aap ko un ka ilm hua to baithne lage. Phir un ke paas nikle aur farmaya: Main ne tumhare kiye mein se jo dekha use jaan liya. Phir namaz parho ae logon apne gharon mein. Kyunke afzal namaz aadmi ki apne ghar mein namaz hai, farz ke siwa."
"448","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dakhil hue to do sutunon ke darmiyan ek rassi bandhi hui thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye rassi kaisi hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Ye Zainab ki rassi hai. Phir jab wo sust hotin to us se latak jatin. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nahi, use khol do. Tum mein se har ek apni chusti mein namaz parhe. Phir jab sust ho to use chahiye ke baith jaye."
"449","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas dakhil hue jabke un ke paas ek aurat thi. Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Falan, us ki namaz ka zikr karti hain. Aap ne farmaya: Bas, tum par lazim hai jitni taqat rakho. Allah ki qasam! Allah nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao. Aur Aap ko deen mein sab se mehboob wo tha jis par us ka karne wala hamesha rahe."
"450","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein oonghe to use chahiye ke so jaye yahan tak ke us se neend door ho jaye. Kyunke tum mein se jab koi namaz parhe jabke wo oongh raha ho to wo nahi janta, shayad wo maghfirat mange aur apne aap ko bura kahe."
"451","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne raat mein masjid mein ek qari ko parhte suna. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah us par rehem farmaye. Beshak us ne mujhe falan aur falan ayat yaad dila di jo main ne falan aur falan surat se gira di thi."
"452","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Quran wale ki misal bandhi hui oontniyon wale ki misal jaisi hai. Agar wo un ki nigehdasht kare to unhe rok lega, aur agar unhe chhor de to wo chali jayengi."
"453","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Un mein se ek ka ye kehna bura hai ke main falan aur falan ayat bhool gaya. Balke use bhulaya gaya. Aur Quran yaad karo, kyunke wo mardon ke seenon se nikalne mein maweshiyon se zyada tez hai."
"454","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Quran ki nigehdasht karo. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak wo apni rassiyon mein bandhe oonton se zyada tez nikalne wala hai."
"455","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo kehte they: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne kisi cheez ko aise ijazat nahi di jaise Nabi ko ijazat di ke wo Quran se khush-ilhani kare, matlab buland awaz se parhe."
"456","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne un se farmaya: Ae Abu Musa! Beshak tumhe Aal Dawud ke mizaron mein se ek mizar diya gaya hai."
"457","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Makkah ki fatah ke din apni oontni par dekha jabke Wo Surah Fath parh rahe they, tarji se. Unhon ne kaha: Agar log mere ird-gird jama na hote to main tarji karta jaisa unhon ne tarji ki."
"458","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Kahf parhi jabke ghar mein janwar tha. Phir wo bidakne laga. To us ne salam phera. Phir ek dhund ya badal ne use gher liya. Phir us ne is ka Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Parho ae falan! Kyunke ye sukoon hai jo Quran ke liye nazil hua, ya Quran ke liye utra."
"459","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usaid bin Hudair (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab wo raat mein Surah Baqara parh rahe they jabke un ka ghoda un ke paas bandha tha, to ghoda chalne laga. Phir wo khamosh ho gaye to wo khamosh ho gaya. Phir unhon ne parha to ghoda chalne laga. Phir wo khamosh ho gaye aur ghoda khamosh ho gaya. Phir unhon ne parha to ghoda chalne laga. Phir wo phire, jabke un ka beta Yahya us ke qareeb tha. To unhe dar hua ke wo use lag jaye. Phir jab unhon ne use kheench liya to unhon ne apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya yahan tak ke wo use na dekhte. Phir jab subah hui to unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Parho ae Ibn Hudair! Parho ae Ibn Hudair! Unhon ne kaha: Phir mujhe dar hua Ya Rasulullah! Ke wo Yahya ko raund de, jabke wo us ke qareeb tha. Phir main ne apna sar uthaya aur us ki taraf phira. Phir main ne apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya to sayeban jaisa tha jis mein chiraghon jaisi cheezein thein. Phir wo nikla yahan tak ke main use na dekhun. Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum jante ho wo kya tha? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Wo farishte they jo tumhari awaz se qareeb aaye. Aur agar tum parhte to subah karte ke log use dekhte, wo un se chhupi na rehti."
"460","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa al-Ash'ari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Momin jo Quran parhta hai us ki misal turanj jaisi hai, us ki khushboo umda aur us ka zaiqa umda. Aur momin jo Quran nahi parhta us ki misal khajoor jaisi hai, us ki khushboo nahi aur us ka zaiqa meetha. Aur munafiq jo Quran parhta hai us ki misal rehan jaisi hai, us ki khushboo umda aur us ka zaiqa kadwa. Aur munafiq jo Quran nahi parhta us ki misal indraayan jaisi hai, us ki khushboo nahi aur us ka zaiqa kadwa."
"461","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo Quran parhta hai jabke wo use yaad rakhta hai wo izzat wale nek likhne walon ke sath hai. Aur jo parhta hai jabke wo use yaad karta hai, aur wo us par bhari hai, to us ke liye do ajr hain."
"462","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ubayy se farmaya: Beshak Allah ne mujhe hukm farmaya hai ke tumhe [lam yakun] parh kar sunaun. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ne mera naam liya? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Phir wo roye."
"463","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe parh kar sunao. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Main tumhe parh kar sunaun jabke tum par nazil hua hai? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main chahta hun ke use apne siwa se sunun. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Nisa parhi, yahan tak ke jab main [phir kya haal hoga jab hum har ummat se gawah layenge aur tumhe in par gawah layenge] par pahuncha to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Roko ya thehro. Phir main ne Aap ki dono aankhein dekhein ke beh rahi thein."
"464","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud se Alqama ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Hims mein they. Phir Ibn Mas'ud ne Surah Yusuf parhi. To ek shakhs ne kaha: Aise nazil nahi hui. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko parh kar sunayi to Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne acha kiya. Aur unhon ne us se sharab ki boo payi. To unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jama karte ho ke Allah ki kitab ko jhutlao aur sharab piyo? Phir unhon ne use hadd mari."
"465","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud al-Badri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Surah Baqara ki aakhri do ayatein, jo unhe raat mein parhe wo use kafi hongi."
"466","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Rashk sirf do mein hai: Ek shakhs jise Allah ne Quran diya aur wo use raat aur din ke auqat mein parhta hai. Aur ek shakhs jise Allah ne maal diya aur wo use raat aur din ke auqat mein kharch karta hai."
"467","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Rashk sirf do mein hai: Ek shakhs jise Allah ne maal diya aur use haq mein kharch karne par lagaya. Aur ek shakhs jise Allah ne hikmat di aur wo us se faisla karta hai aur sikhata hai."
"468","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hisham bin Hakim bin Hizam ko Surah Furqan us se mukhtalif parhte suna jaisa main parhta hun. Jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe wahi parhayi thi. Aur main qareeb tha ke us par jaldi karun. Phir main ne use mohlat di yahan tak ke wo phira. Phir main ne use us ki chadar se pakda aur use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya. To main ne arz kiya: Beshak main ne ise us se mukhtalif parhte suna jaisa Aap ne mujhe parhayi thi. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Use chhor do. Phir Aap ne us se farmaya: Parho. To us ne parha. Aap ne farmaya: Aise nazil hui hai. Phir Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Parho. To main ne parha. To Aap ne farmaya: Aise nazil hui hai. Beshak Quran saat harfon par nazil hua hai. Phir parho jo tumhe aasan ho."
"469","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujhe ek harf par parhaya. Phir main un se zyada mangta raha yahan tak ke saat harfon tak pahuncha."
"470","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud se Abu Wail ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Ibn Mas'ud ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Main ne Mufassal raat mein ek rakat mein parhi. To unhon ne kaha: Sher ki tarah jaldi jaldi. Beshak main un naziron ko janta hun jinhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) milate they. Phir unhon ne Mufassal mein se bees surtein zikr ki, har rakat mein do surtein."
"471","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Wo parhte [to kya koi naseehat lene wala hai?]."
"472","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu al-Darda se Ibrahim ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ke sathi Abu al-Darda ke paas aaye. To unhon ne unhe talash kiya aur paya. To unhon ne kaha: Tum mein se kaun Abdullah ki qiraat parhta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Hum sab. Unhon ne kaha: Phir tum mein se kaun sab se zyada yaad rakhne wala hai? To unhon ne Alqama ki taraf ishara kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne use kaise parhte suna [aur raat jab chha jaye]? To Alqama ne kaha: [Aur mard aur aurat]. Unhon ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aise parhte suna. Aur ye chahte hain ke main [aur jo mard aur aurat paida kiya] parhun. Allah ki qasam! Main un ki pairwi nahi karunga."
"473","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab se Ibn Abbas ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere paas pasandeeda mardon ne gawahi di, aur un mein mere nazdeek sab se pasandeeda Umar hain, ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Fajr ke baad namaz se mana farmaya yahan tak ke suraj chamke, aur Asr ke baad yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho jaye."
"474","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Fajr ke baad koi namaz nahi yahan tak ke suraj buland ho jaye, aur Asr ke baad koi namaz nahi yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho jaye."
"475","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apni namaz se suraj tulu hone aur ghuroob hone ka irada na karo."
"476","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab suraj ka kinara nikle to namaz chhor do yahan tak ke zahir ho jaye. Aur jab suraj ka kinara ghayab ho to namaz chhor do yahan tak ke ghuroob ho jaye."
"477","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama se Kuraib ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Ibn Abbas, Miswar bin Makhrama aur Abd al-Rahman bin Azhar ne use Aisha ki taraf bheja. To unhon ne kaha: Hum sab ki taraf se unhe salam kaho, aur un se Asr ki namaz ke baad do rakaton ke bare mein poochho. Aur un se kaho: Hamein khabar di gayi hai ke tum unhe parhti ho. Aur hamein pahuncha hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se mana farmaya tha. Aur Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Aur main Umar bin al-Khattab ke sath logon ko un se marta tha. Kuraib ne kaha: Phir main Aisha ke paas dakhil hua aur unhe wo pahunchaya jo unhon ne mujhe bheja tha. To unhon ne kaha: Umm Salama se poochho. Phir main un ke paas nikla aur unhe un ke qaul ki khabar di. Phir unhon ne mujhe Umm Salama ki taraf us jaisi se lautaya jo unhon ne mujhe Aisha ki taraf bheja tha. To Umm Salama ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko un se manع farmate suna. Phir main ne Aap ko unhe parhte dekha jab Aap ne Asr parhi. Phir Aap dakhil hue jabke mere paas Ansar mein se Bani Haram ki chand aurtein thein. Phir main ne Aap ki taraf londi ko bheja. Phir main ne kaha: Un ke pehlu mein khadi ho, un se kaho: Tum se Umm Salama kehti hain: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne tumhe in dono se manع farmate suna hai aur tumhe dekhti hun ke tum unhe parhte ho. Phir agar Wo apne hath se ishara farmayein to un se peechhe hat jana. Phir londi ne aisa kiya. To Aap ne apne hath se ishara farmaya. Phir wo Aap se peechhe hati. Phir jab Aap phire to farmaya: Ae Abu Umayya ki beti! Tum ne Asr ke baad do rakaton ke bare mein poochha. Aur beshak mere paas Abd al-Qais mein se kuchh log aaye to unhon ne mujhe Zuhr ke baad wali do rakaton se rok diya. To ye wahi hain."
"478","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Do rakatein aisi hain jinhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chhup kar aur elaniya kabhi tark na farmate: Fajr ki namaz se pehle do rakatein, aur Asr ke baad do rakatein."
"479","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab muazzin azan kehta to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sathiyon mein se kuchh log sutunon ki taraf daudte, yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) niklte, jabke wo aise hi Maghrib se pehle do rakatein parhte. Aur azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan kuchh na hota."
"480","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har do elanon ke darmiyan namaz hai, har do elanon ke darmiyan namaz hai. Phir teesri martaba farmaya: Jo chahe."
"481","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne do girohon mein se ek se namaz parhi, jabke doosra giroh dushman ke samne tha. Phir wo phire aur apne sathiyon ki jagah khade hue. Phir wo aaye to Aap ne unhe ek rakat parhayi, phir Aap ne unhe salam kiya. Phir ye khade hue aur apni rakat poori ki, aur ye khade hue aur apni rakat poori ki."
"482","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Abi Hathma (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Imam Qibla ki taraf munh karke khada hota hai, jabke un mein se ek giroh us ke sath hota hai, aur ek giroh dushman ki taraf se, un ke chehre dushman ki taraf. Phir wo unhe jo us ke sath hain ek rakat parhata hai. Phir wo khade hote hain aur apne liye ek rakat ruku karte hain aur apni jagah do sajde karte hain. Phir ye un ki jagah jate hain. Phir wo unhe ek rakat ruku karata hai. Phir us ke liye do hain. Phir wo ruku karte hain aur do sajde karte hain."
"483","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khawwat bin Jubair se Salih bin Khawwat ke hawale se, us se jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Dhat al-Riqa ke din hazir tha, khauf ki namaz parhi. Ke ek giroh Aap ke sath saf bandhe, aur ek giroh dushman ke samne. Phir Aap ne us se jo Aap ke sath thi ek rakat parhi, phir khade rahe. Aur unhon ne apne liye poori ki. Phir wo phire aur dushman ke samne saf bandhi. Aur doosra giroh aaya. Phir Aap ne unhe wo rakat parhayi jo Aap ki namaz mein se baqi thi. Phir baith kar thehre aur unhon ne apne liye poori ki. Phir Aap ne unhe salam kiya."
"484","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Dhat al-Riqa mein they. Phir jab hum sayadar darakht par aate to use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye chhor dete. Phir mushrikon mein se ek shakhs aaya jabke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki talwar darakht se latki thi. Phir us ne use khench liya. Phir us ne kaha: Tum mujh se darte ho? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Us ne kaha: Tumhe mujh se kaun bachayega? Aap ne farmaya: Allah. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sathiyon ne use dhamkaya. Aur namaz khadi ki gayi. Phir Aap ne ek giroh se do rakatein parhein, phir wo peechhe hate. Aur doosre giroh se do rakatein parhein. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye chaar thein, aur qaum ke liye do rakatein."
